==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has reached a massive 100 million downloads worldwide! In thanks to all of our players, we've got special events available for a limited time!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between March 14th (11:00am) and April 7th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Grab a huge Cat Food payout from the Wildcat SlotsⅡ!'''}}<br>
Match the images to earn a big Cat Food prize!

Visit the Cat Base to check out {{Color|#4A86E8|'''the special Wildcat SlotsⅡ for a limited time during the 100 Million Download event!'''}}<br>
Give the slots a spin to earn {{Color|#34A853|'''at least 1000 Cat Food'''}}!<br>
Don't miss this chance to collect a huge Cat Food haul!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
During this event, {{Color|#0000FF|'''units can be levelled up for 1/2 of their normal cost!'''}}<br>
※ Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 100 Million DL Celebration Stamps now available!'''}}<br>
Log-in during the event to claim fantastic rewards! Log-in every day to {{Color|#4A86E8|'''earn up to 5 Cat Tickets and 5 Rare Tickets'''}}!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Earn powerful allies with the 100 Million DL Celebration Ticket!'''}}<br>
The 100 Million DL Celebration Ticket Pack is on sale for a limited time!<br>
The pack includes {{Color|#34A853|'''610 Cat Food'''}} and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''100 Million DL Celebration Ticket'''}} which is used in the special 100 Million DL Celebration Capsules!<br>
The limited time Capsules have a chance to drop limited Uber Rare units from Uberfest and Epicfest as well as Legend Rare units!

Now is your chance to bolster the strength of your Cat Army with these powerful units!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Available from March 14th (11:00am) until April 7th, 2025 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''※ 100 Million DL Celebration Ticket can only be used on the 100 Million DL Celebration Capsules until April 21 (10:59AM).'''<br>
