※ If the ticket pack is not visible, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● 100 Million DL Celebration Missions on now!'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base and tap the Missions tab for limited-time 100 Million DL Missions! Clear all 9 Missions to receive a {{Color|#0000FF|'''Platinum Shard'''}}!

Grab it while you can!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between March 14th (11:00am) and April 7th (10:59am)!'''}}

※These Special missions can only be completed until April 7th (10:59am), so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Legend Tickets, on sale!'''}}<br>
Only for a limited time, the new item Legend Tickets are available to buy! A new Capsule set where that only gives out Uber Rare or better heroes?! Plus, an exclusive hero only available from this set?!?!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Available from March 24th (11:00am) until April 7th, 2025 (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
An improvement on even the Platinum Capsules! Don't miss out!

